title: "Threat as a Checkable Predicate: code and results"
abstract: >-
  Code and result artefacts for measuring whether anomaly-based web attack
  detection separates genuine attacks from legitimate-but-unusual traffic,
  a category absent from public intrusion-detection corpora.
